            This is the definition of the formal system
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/CompLF"} CompLF
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/CompLF+v0"} zero
            and one, but you’re not missing anything interesting.
